Not included
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project contains no code, resources, native libraries or cryptographic keys from
com.xjcheng.musictageditor 1.2.5.2. Service endpoint URLs and protocol details were
reimplemented from publicly documented network behaviour; the tag engine uses upstream
TagLib rather than the original app's binary.
